        "main-reseller-comparison": {
          "type": "reseller_comparison",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Direct Supplier or authorised dealer network: which route suits your office?",
            "subheading": "<p>Most UK buyers comparing SoundBox and Teknion aren't choosing between two pod designs, they're choosing between two ways of buying office pods: direct from a manufacturer, or via an authorised dealer network. Both routes are valid. They just suit different projects.</p>",
            "sb_tagline": "DIRECT SUPPLIER",
            "sb_title": "SoundBox",
            "sb_description": "<p>A UK office pod manufacturer that designs, builds and sells its own acoustic pod range. Specification, pricing, lead time and warranty all handled by one team.</p>",
            "sb_features": "A curated own-brand range covering all office use cases\nDirect pricing — no additional supply-chain layer\nWarranty, spares and repairs handled in-house",
            "comp_tagline": "AUTHORISED DEALER NETWORK",
            "comp_title": "Teknion",
            "comp_description": "<p>Single-brand manufacturer sold through an authorised UK/EU dealer network. Office pods are one line within a broad furniture catalogue.</p>",
            "comp_features": "Vertically integrated manufacturer — designs and builds its own products\nSold in the UK via authorised dealers, not direct from Teknion\nPods sit within a wider catalogue covering desking, seating, storage and architectural interiors"
          }
        },
