          "settings": {
            "heading": "When SoundBox makes more sense",
            "subheading": "<p>The honest answer: it depends on what you're optimising for. Some projects suit an authorised dealer network; others suit going direct to a manufacturer. Here's where each route earns its place.</p>",
            "card_tagline": "WHEN SOUNDBOX IS THE RIGHT CHOICE",
            "card_title": "Bespoke specs, tighter timelines, single-point accountability",
            "benefits": "The SoundBox range covers your project's use cases, meaning you buy from the team that designed and built the pod, not a separate supplier.\nAftercare matters: spare parts come off the same production line, not a third-party supply chain.\nYou want manufacturer-direct pricing — published list prices on every pod, with no reseller quote stage in the way.\nYou want brand consistency across multiple sites or floors, with one warranty contact for every pod.\nYou want one team accountable for design, build, warranty and spares — not a chain that passes through to a separate manufacturer.\nYou value direct access to the manufacturer for technical and specification questions."
          }
